  "title": "Renewables: TotalEnergies Divests 50% of 1.4 GW Solar Portfolio in North America",
  "summary": "Paris, September 29th, 2025 – TotalEnergies has signed an agreement with insurance vehicles and accounts managed by KKR, a leading global investment firm, for the sale of 50% of a 1.4 GW solar portfolio in North America. This transaction – which aligns with TotalEnergies’ renewables business model – values the portfolio at an enterprise value of $1.25 billion. […]",
